{
  "version": 1,
  "doc": [
    "Gate order (android/core Gate.evaluate): 1 normalize (lowercase, IDN->punycode, strip trailing dot/port/userinfo, PSL incl. private section -> registrable_domain)",
    "2 Safe Browsing (stub in this build) hit -> Block(safe_browsing)",
    "3 always-analyze exceptions: shortener host -> Unknown(shortener) [caller resolves redirects and gates the final URL again]; ugc match -> Unknown(ugc)",
    "4 known-good: registrable_domain in brand_domains.json, Tranco top-100k set, or the safe-verdict cache -> Pass",
    "5 everything else -> Unknown(unknown_domain). Hosts that are IP literals -> Unknown(ip_host); no registrable domain (bare public suffix / localhost) -> Unknown(no_registrable_domain)",
    "Matching: shorteners/ugc compare against the normalized host. match=exact -> host equals; match=suffix -> host equals or ends with '.'+host. paths are case-sensitive prefixes of the URL path; '/' = any path."
  ],
